# ============================================================================
#  数独（.NET MAUI：Android + Windows）—— 版本库忽略规则
#
#  开源到 GitHub 时的原则：只提交源码、脚本、文档、图标与字体资源；
#  下面这些全部不入库——尤其是第 1 节（体积按 GB 计）与第 4 节（签名密钥）。
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 本地工具链与缓存（体积巨大，绝对不要提交）
#    .toolchain/    项目内置的 .NET SDK（scripts\install-toolchain.ps1 装出来的）
#    .android-sdk/  项目内置的 Android SDK（scripts\build-android.ps1 自动装的，1~2 GB）
#    .cache/        调试脚本与语料缓存
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.toolchain/
.android-sdk/
.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. .NET 构建产物
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.binlog
*.tlog
*.log
*.tmp
*.pdb
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.cache
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
.vs/
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml

# 测试与覆盖率报告
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. 发布 / 打包产物（scripts\publish-windows.ps1 与 build-android.ps1 的产出）
#    publish\windows\ 226 MB、publish\Sudoku-win-x64.zip 83 MB、APK 28 MB —— 都走 Release 页面分发
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
publish/
artifacts/
AppPackages/
BundleArtifacts/
*.appx
*.appxbundle
*.appxupload
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.msixupload
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 签名与密钥（重要：一旦提交就是安全事故，务必确认下面几行没被删掉）
#    keystore/ 目录本身保留（里面有 README 教别人自己生成密钥），只忽略密钥文件本体
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pfx
*.snk
*.mobileprovision
*.cer

# 本机私有的签名口令配置（scripts\build-android.ps1 会自动加载，里面放明文口令）
scripts/local-signing.ps1
*.local.ps1
local-signing.ps1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. 编辑器 / IDE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. 操作系统杂项
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. 其它零碎
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.orig
*.rej
*.bak
*.pidb
*.svd
*.opendb
*.VC.db
mono_crash.*.json
